; tap2sna.py file for Martianoids. Run
;
;   $ tap2sna.py @martianoids.t2s
;
; to create a Z80 snapshot.

https://zxaaa.net/DENIED/Martianoids%20(1987)(Ultimate%20Play%20The%20Game).tzx
Martianoids.z80

--tape-name "MART.tzx"
--sim-load-config accelerator=speedlock

; The tape is a standard-speed BASIC loader: the first CODE block (PIC) is
; the loading screen unpacker, and the second (GAM) is the game itself, loaded
; as plain data at its real address. BASIC then calls USR 24576, whose first
; instruction (JP P,$9601) jumps to the game's start, so stopping the
; simulation at $9601 leaves the whole game at its real addresses.
--start 38401
--stack 24576
